cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, cite it as below."
title: "agent-faultbench: does an agent's defence actually stop an action that should not run?"
abstract: >-
  A conformance suite for agent failure modes. v0.1 measures one case: a model
  reply that is cut off in the middle of a tool call, and whether the client
  executes the half-written call anyway. Evidence is a file on disk, not a log line.
authors:
  - family-names: Yuan
    given-names: Simin
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-10
repository-code: "https://github.com/simin-yuan/agent-faultbench"
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
keywords:
  - agents
  - benchmark
  - reliability
  - fault-injection
  - tool-calling
